  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 501.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish the application procedure and residency requirements for funds appropriated pursuant to RSA 193:19.\n\nSource. #10633, eff 7-2-14 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hedc 500); ss by #14213, eff 3-12-25",
